    "text_full": "Solutions\nTools\nIntegrations\nResources\nPricing\nGet a demo\nLogin\nRegister\nAMAZON WAREHOUSES & PREP CENTERS\nOne click from purchase order to prep center\n\nOne place for all warehouses and prep centers. Connect a prep center and dispatch purchase orders as inbound shipments.\n\nGet Started\nHOW IT WORKS\nFrom warehouse setup to prep dispatch in 3 steps\n\nNo portal switching. The entire prep workflow happens where the order was created.\n\n1\nAdd or sync your warehouses\n\nAdd any warehouse or prep center manually, or select among integrated prep centers and sync warehouses automatically.\n\n2\nAssign to suppliers and purchase orders\n\nLink a warehouse to a supplier so it applies automatically on every PO. Or pick it inline from any purchase order header.\n\n3\nMove products straight to prep\n\nOpen a PO assigned to a synced warehouse and click Send to prep. The inbound shipment is created instantly and linked back to the PO in Seller Assistant.\n\nWHY IT MATTERS\nManaging prep was always the part that broke the workflow\n\nMost sellers still open the prep center portal separately and re-enter PO data by hand. Seller Assistant removes that step entirely.\n\nDIRECT PREP DISPATCH\nNo more copying PO data into a separate portal\n\nBefore this, dispatching a PO to prep meant opening the prep center's portal, creating a shipment manually, and re-entering every item SKU and quantity. The Send to prep button replaces that entire sequence from the PO header.\n\nPREP CENTER DIRECTORY\nPurpose-built prep center integrations\n\nChoose from a growing directory of prep centers with purpose-built integrations. No automation tools, no custom workarounds — connect directly from Seller Assistant. Don't see your prep center? Request it and we'll add it.\n\nWAREHOUSE DATABASE\nOne source of truth for all your locations\n\nWhen you're running dozens of POs across multiple suppliers and prep centers, manual routing breaks down. All warehouses and prep centers in one shared database — assign once per supplier and every PO routes correctly, automatically, regardless of volume.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED\nEverything warehouses database handles\n\nFrom manual entry to live prep dispatch — everything in between.\n\nManual warehouse entry\n\nAdd any warehouse or prep center with name, address, and contact details\n\nPrep center sync\n\nIntegrated warehouses sync automatically into your database\n\nSupplier association\n\nLink a warehouse to a supplier so the correct ship-to is applied automatically on every PO\n\nSelect ship-to from PO\n\nChange the assigned warehouse directly from the PO header\n\nSend to prep\n\nCreate an inbound shipment directly from the PO — one click, no portal switching\n\nShipment linking\n\nThe PO header shows a live link back to the shipment in your prep center portal\n\nShipment unlinking\n\nDetach a shipment from a PO when needed and create a new one without losing the order\n\nTeam access\n\nWarehouses are shared across the team with full edit and delete permissions\n\nWORKFLOW\nWarehouses database connects the order to the prep center. These tools close the loop\n\nFrom the PO to prep to listing — every step happens inside Seller Assistant.\n\nSource\nPurchase Orders\n\nAssign a warehouse inline and dispatch the PO to prep directly from the order header\n\nSource\nSuppliers\n\nLink a warehouse to a supplier so the ship-to address is set automatically on every purchase order\n\nSource\nFBA Shipments\n\nTrack inbound shipments after your prep center dispatches inventory to Amazon\n\nList\nLister\n\nList products from purchase orders that have moved through prep and are ready to go live\n\nCOMPLETE YOUR WORKFLOW\nThe pipeline starts long before the warehouse\n\nBuild your order list before anything reaches a purchase order.\n\nPrice List Analyzer\n\nTurn a supplier catalog into a shortlist of profitable products ready to order.\n\nAnalyze\nProducts Database\n\nSource products into your pipeline and push them into purchase orders.\n\nSource\nSKUs\n\nTrack landed costs per SKU with prep and inbound fees factored in automatically.\n\nList\nBrand Analyzer\n\nResearch brand performance before committing to a supplier.\n\nAnalyze\nFrequently Asked Questions\nVisit Help Center\nHow do I send a purchase order to a prep center?\nHow do I connect my prep center to Seller Assistant?\nWhat prep centers does Seller Assistant integrate with?\nCan I manage multiple warehouses and prep centers in one place?\nHow do I track inbound shipments sent to a prep center?\nCan I assign different prep centers to different purchase orders?\nReady to connect your orders to prep?\n\nCentralize your warehouses, sync your prep center, and send purchase orders to prep without leaving Seller Assistant.\n\nGet Started\n\nNot sure which plan fits your sourcing workflow? Chat with our team — we're happy to help.\n\nNAVIGATION\nHome\nPricing\nDownload\nSOLUTIONS\nOnline Arbitrage\nWholesale\nDropshipping\nAgencies\nPRODUCTS\nPrice List Analyzer\nLister\nPurchase Orders\nSuppliers\nWarehouses\nSeller Assistant Extension\nIP-Alert by Seller Assistant\nVPN by Seller Assistant\nBulk Restriction Checker\nSeller Spy\nBrand Analyzer\nFREE TOOLS\nASIN Lookup\nIP-Alert Lookup\nSupplier Finder\nASIN to UPC\nUPC to ASIN\nEAN to ASIN\nFEATURES\nFBM & FBA Calculator\nVAT Calculator\nAmazon IP-Alert\nSide Panel View\nAmazon Quick View\nStorefront Widget\nAlerts & Flags\nRestrictions Checker\nSales Estimator\nOffers\nVariation Viewer\nStock Checker\nASIN Grabber\nSub-Accounts for VAs\nExport to Google Sheets\nNotes\nALTERNATIVES\nAnalyzer.Tools Alternative\nScan Unlimited Alternative\nSmartScout Alternative\nRevSeller Alternative\nBuyBotPro Alternative\nAZInsight Alternative\nSellerAmp Alternative\nIP-Alert Alternative\nDS Quick View Alternative\nPARTNERS\nAffiliate Program\nPartners\nAmazon Experts\nPress Kit\nRESOURCES\nBlog\nGet a Demo\nHelp Center\nOffice Hours\nNews & Updates\nProduct Roadmap\nReviews\nINTEGRATIONS